{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "38ab742cdfb5461ae8ec4bd704305398db6b24a55d352762d305be421c5e09f6", "ja": "光り咲く花に照らされて", "zh": "浸沐在花朵绽放的光芒之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec8ac57d03bf5a80a60fd83fa94afb2cc33b5f82905cf2883f9749faa735e95f", "ja": "行方不明になってしまった未来を探すと、\n彼女は月明かりに照らされた花畑に佇んでい\nた。その姿に見惚れるプロデューサー。みん\nなの元に帰ってきた未来が星梨花に摘んだ花\nを渡すと、星梨花に笑顔が戻った。", "zh": "出发寻找失踪的未来时，\n发现她正站在洒满月光的花田中，\n她的身影让制作人看得出神。未来回到\n大家身边后，把为星梨花摘的花送给她，\n帮助星梨花重拾了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "516e3e2718fc1165c8f67994aef72acb97f9994cfde6ce08aabb4d86381a606d", "ja": "（未来……。どこまで行ったんだ？\n道を外れてなければいいが……）", "zh": "（未来……你究竟跑哪去了？\n希望没有偏离道路就好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3f083dbfdd0bbab078860a33ddf74187f61f2190b7a22c5b6eb6d6cfade314c4", "ja": "（……ん？　森が切れて花畑みたいになってる。\nあそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（……嗯？没有森林了，再过去变得像一片花田。\n在那里的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "290dc504c04cee338dd0a1a873dcaa405dd66099e63e3da2e4ddde6cd89913e4", "ja": "（未来……。月明かりの下、花に囲まれて……）", "zh": "（未来……在月光下，四周花朵遍布……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4c1a264a31f247f9d4888c027de49e0b4f5cb4279dc167ddd5989eedbb574692", "ja": "（こういうところで見ると、すごく絵になる。\nさすが、アイドルだな……）", "zh": "（在这种情景下，看过去就像一幅画。\n真不愧是偶像啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "789b2f3873ddfd192a988ef9d20007e44237796bb35b8bdf45be2bc66c8867b8", "ja": "くうう、こんな素晴らしいシーンなのに、カメラを\n持って来てないとは！　ありさ一生の不覚です～！", "zh": "唔唔，明明这么美好的一幕就在眼前，\n亚利沙却没有带相机来！真是这辈子最大的错误～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "a1e8e86c528d15ba4e10029ad6fb19fafa1def81f71253554502b9b1f1a3e45f", "ja": "仕方ないのでありさ、心のシャッターを切りますっ！\nカシャカシャ！　カシャカシャカシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "没办法了，亚利沙只能按下内心的快门！\n喀嚓！喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f3e217cea72e74146c6a48f2139502c706b61b017d1bd5f67291fea834bb8886", "ja": "亜利沙も……無事でよかった。\nありがとう、ちゃんと未来についててくれて。", "zh": "亚利沙……幸好你也没事。\n谢谢你有紧跟着未来过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "7c917c611b8ede8247bf2df231c3f70a5d04952ce610978575719b98b064f3eb", "ja": "……はっ、{$P$}さん！？\nあ、今何か言いました？　ありさ忙しいんですケド！", "zh": "……啊，{$P$}先生！？\n你刚刚有说话吗？亚利沙现在很忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "becfdc47926d5797085549cbd4cbe0e47b188ff43c3b316a21d3a543da5fc58d", "ja": "ごめんごめん。心ゆくまで\nエアシャッターを切りまくってくれ。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。\n你就尽情去按你的空气快门吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b9f175b0f2e3b2891d647d1e328e05da6a0c5c07ae304ff91320166b1313034", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nそれに、ありさちゃんも！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n还有亚利沙也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d1ccc2d88c8780b019d8550404115217dad1bca1ac251c0601882e873776f1ee", "ja": "未来、探したぞ。\nだめじゃないか、勝手に行動したら。", "zh": "未来，我一直在找你。\n擅自行动也太不应该了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe2238a326d68302617eb3f42ad6c9ba3c20f58975af11f7a0998d013f3e3bb1", "ja": "ごめんなさい、でも……。", "zh": "对不起，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c638a4d44f51b1fc0525203f420dbc2a29b920a63da95bd8e1cb80226fbb6964", "ja": "みんなも心配してたんだぞ？　亜利沙がついて来て\nくれたからいいけど、ひとりで別行動なんて……。", "zh": "大家都很担心你啊，幸好有亚利沙跟着你过来，\n独自一个人分头行动实在是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "4f2cfe9249f6a9695beb6fcbabbdf5f0dbe7faf90dc6eb4b3100fa00192bd19b", "ja": "ありさちゃん……そうだったの？", "zh": "亚利沙……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "017c8c428c3e94d2c01ace8b35ee3e92172e2e8fa258110039a28b204efc69d4", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん、\n未来ちゃんをあんまりしからないであげてください！", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}先生，\n请不要太过责怪未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "a3fff3d4821e4125b9b9ed9111ff942c0edda76c714e050c56233794d4968ae5", "ja": "未来ちゃんは、この先どうなってるかを確かめに\n来たんですよね？　星梨花ちゃんのために。", "zh": "未来是要确认接下来的路况才来的吧？\n这都是为了星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9613a3b429fef12b059c70655dbd6932bed99911d354dc05811ea7a91e90f49d", "ja": "……そうなのか？　未来。", "zh": "……是这样吗，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "85a3177d47b3a759d8f145848731cbdafd785baf0deac93d7a8fe7dca8a91379", "ja": "はい……。道がこの先でどうなってるのか、\nわかった方が元気でるかなって……。", "zh": "是的……我想星梨花如果知道接下来的路况，\n说不定会打起精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "459c94611d40f74924fd4dd559b5fd782c08f124c141084f852a04b9b6c0dc26", "ja": "そしたら、途中でこのお花畑を見つけたんです！\nすっごくキレイで、びっくりしました！", "zh": "接着，我在途中发现了这片花田！\n真的很漂亮，吓了我一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c55586efec3482cefcfd681a9fdda248067f7f46ec7bdff15b43b51db93cb36", "ja": "それで、星梨花にも見せたくて、\nキレイに咲いてるのを探してたんですけど……。", "zh": "所以我也想让星梨花看看，\n刚刚一直在找开得很漂亮的花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c539d1167b0b7b3b8fca7558063614bcb9303d4cc00fc4eeaff5937bc5605662", "ja": "そうか……。うん、わかった。\nでも、もう二度とひとりで行動しないこと。いいな？", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，我知道了。\n不过，你不能再单独行动了，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb45be08b0a5678a0bbdc15acf4295af6033a5e9638eea308086c53f78daf361", "ja": "はい……ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん、\nありさちゃん。もうしません！", "zh": "是……对不起，{$P$}先生、\n亚利沙。我不会再犯了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "de4a4f0996daa6833d469c5d76247e2034986909166642a1009f2db321eb43ce", "ja": "よし、それでいい。\nじゃあ、急いで3人で、花を探そうか。", "zh": "嗯，这样就好。\n那么，我们三个赶紧一起找花吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "02695ae7d588166502ad840702058584359fbfb6f75b31e4015de0e146790eb8", "ja": "そうですね！　星梨花ちゃんへのお土産に、\nとびきりキレイなお花をみんなで探しましょう♪", "zh": "也对！我们一起寻找超级漂亮的花，\n带回去当成小礼物送给星梨花吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "b4dff611c4195641f66e324d30b006b97d14b1150011476956148584e86976d7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありさちゃん……。\nえへへっ、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、亚利沙……\n嘿嘿，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92", "ja": "ただいまー！", "zh": "我回来了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "19c6ed3e21371f19e54541178503f36f995c5dade5fcc97ed62418a3bd72638c", "ja": "未来さん！", "zh": "未来姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "afb081b76be4dfddb2f2755a0de6558e3df2936913817b10b7f40a11c84be916", "ja": "亜利沙も、{$P$}も！\nよかった……！", "zh": "还有亚利沙跟{$P$}！\n太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c0483e20dca453733ef6725631d4b63185337aac8eea886c9bba006ea0f5e31d", "ja": "もう……。あ、でも、きっともう\nお説教は済んでますよね？", "zh": "真是的……\n啊，不过未来应该已经被训过话了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "76a208f995813583451acdc3c37275f7e51999f95eba73a7747e0ea37de94035", "ja": "ああ、一応な。反省してくれたから、\n許してやってくれ。", "zh": "嗯，我有训她几句了。\n她已经好好反省了，就原谅她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "38b42817a73f0204df04ff0e8e1ef834b5569aa2052999c1932671ced1793de2", "ja": "でも、本当によかったです！\n未来さん、どこもケガしてないんですよね？", "zh": "不过，真是太好了！\n未来姊姊，你应该没有受什么伤吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "73647b9ca5d393e22805f1e6ab2abf7d43088fce2a158816746a08e1076df83a", "ja": "うん、大丈夫だよ。心配かけてごめんね！\n琴葉ちゃんも風花さんも！", "zh": "嗯，我没事。抱歉让你担心了！\n还有琴叶跟风花姊也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "7324a6034caef1020a8bcd59a4c18efbe38a6451f10533f6259144c9bf599f49", "ja": "いいんです！　わたしは、ひとりで勝手に\nドキドキしていただけで……。", "zh": "没关系！\n只是我自己爱担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "acc6b53cc85830608c95907eadf79b1428f95da8c5e5b527062d2db9c29070b2", "ja": "よくないでしょ、星梨花ちゃん。\n今にも泣きそうだったのに。", "zh": "有关系吧，星梨花。\n你刚才都差点要哭出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "81a5833d343b50e3e09d6d7fb2bba30c34883685404367944d855215bc591ba5", "ja": "ふふっ、琴葉ちゃんもね？", "zh": "呵呵，琴叶也一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "ada40ea24c7d640c523a8d0162ef5f44cef333ea79f666ef08ab98140a293a88", "ja": "わ、私のことは、別に……っ。", "zh": "我、我才没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "f352e08557146f9df56ad2e1da6fbb3a5976cd5a528fbb5b24b83b6d1603b22d", "ja": "ホントにごめんなさい！　でもね、この先に、とっても\nキレイなお花畑があったんだよ！　ほら、お土産！", "zh": "真的很抱歉！不过啊，再走下去有非常漂亮的花田喔！\n来，给你的小礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "62d603923f8c212bfc351a54d7d0ea885bd1f3bc2ac0222da78a3d8ae126c615", "ja": "わぁ、キレイなお花……！\nすごいです、未来さん！", "zh": "哇，好漂亮的花……！\n好棒喔，未来姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "7af06ed4e2124938999e9649093c0061e36e497d8e08d12caa831c0a235d0a52", "ja": "ありさちゃんが見つけてくれたんだ～♪\nいっちばんキレイなの！", "zh": "这是亚利沙帮你找到的喔～♪\n最漂亮的一朵花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "30eacdd28e6a3dd53199df484cb6f039ea2dae53298f4376d4c96703a74b7a81", "ja": "ムフフ。ありさアイからは逃れられませんよ！\nでも探そうって言ったのは、未来ちゃんですからね♪", "zh": "唔呼呼，花朵可躲不过亚利沙的眼睛！\n不过提出要采花的人是未来喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "68271f5964feb47f3e278fa46c6d583749decc473fa1aa1650c65f21a59d800e", "ja": "みなさん……ありがとうございます！\nわたし、本当に元気がわいてきちゃいました！", "zh": "各位……谢谢你们！\n我真的觉得开始充满活力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1043_041fuk", "source_sha256": "16cacb5f3c3a4412136d572ea2f7bbf8c59c4304aec0be8b36608c407c185b28", "ja": "ふふっ、未来ちゃんも戻ってきて、星梨花ちゃんも\n元気になったことだし。そろそろ出発しましょうか。", "zh": "呵呵，既然未来已经回来，星梨花也打起精神了，\n我们差不多该出发了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "c771628626ae44e24a8b3d958c514b38a6e4e3e63dfc1d09aae67fdc3bf6e60f", "ja": "そうですね。\n{$P$}、引率お願いします。", "zh": "也对呢。\n{$P$}，要麻烦你带队了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "84444ef4ea2ff788acb98e6b915de4f8e25f56d60ed83f5ad48911c57ef3f510", "ja": "ああ、ルートの予習もばっちりだ。\nみんな、流星群のピークまでに、頂上を目指すぞ！", "zh": "嗯，关于路线我也做好功课了。\n各位，在流星雨的高峰期来临前，我们要抵达山顶喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
