{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1051_p", "source_sha256": "19a59fd03c8bc3dc21135c5d2d6dc2df5f6fec6874839c34f39e594cbc83df1d", "ja": "（それぞれが少しずつの冒険をしながら、\nみんなで山を登って行く）", "zh": "（大家都各自经历小小的冒险，\n同时一起向山顶迈进。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "aef0ced2197a03a4430ef9eaa8caa28c8c9f909c469d20a365a7b27df3a12acf", "ja": "（山頂でみつけられるのは、きっと……\n目的の流星群だけじゃない）", "zh": "（而我们能够在山顶找到的……\n一定不仅是原先想看的流星雨。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
